        "usageExplanationZh": "可指實際的武力衝突（armed clash），也可指意見或風格上的不合（a clash of opinions）。",
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "There was a violent clash between protesters and police.",
            "zh": "抗議者與警方之間發生了激烈衝突。"
          }
        ]
      },
